{"seq":25,"trial_id":"v04-transfer-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-mu-v04-rehearsal/rx-06-wv2db9/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T15:15:47.444Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"db918eda395c064003444cc9a61154e5a0fcf3bf8d4ba9a0caf5ed14be0e3cac","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04TRA0001","text":"Hi Linnea, here's what I found for Sablehithe Paper Mill (SPM, a Canyon account owned by Sebastien Keldale):\n\n• Renewal date: December 10, 2026. That's from Moss's Canyon digest dated Sept 3. Heads up: it doesn't match the January 20, 2027 date you mentioned from memory in #sierra-team back in May. I'd go with the digest, but Sebastien can confirm if it matters for the file.\n• Main contact: Lysander Vesfield, Transportation Manager at Sablehithe Paper Mill. He leads the Indigo rollout on their side. That's from the Canyon cheat sheet (updated Sept 28).\n\nFor reference, the weekly Indigo working session with them is Thursdays at 9:05 AM.","thread_ts":"1792245600.000130"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04TRA0001","ts":"1792245600.000131","thread_ts":"1792245600.000130"}}
